  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "**New listing due to ownership change** Welcome to Harmony Sands, a recently updated GULF FRONT townhome on Seagrove Beach boasting unobstructed views of the Gulf from the main floor and master bedroom decks. A short 100 steps from the sand, enjoying a day at the beach doesn’t get much easier! At the end of the day you can rinse off the sand in the outdoor shower before heading up to the air conditioning to relax.<br><br>This property is ideal for a peaceful family getaway. Accommodating up to six guests, you will enjoy a master bedroom with king bed, second bedroom with a queen bed, and a cozy private room with built-in twin bunkbeds. The queen bedroom and bunk room are connected, separated by a pocket door (the bunkroom is a pass through).<br><br>There are Smart TVs in the living room and all bedrooms, a wall-mounted arcade console in the bunk room featuring over 6,000 retro and classic video games, and a plush sectional to watch a movie or enjoy the sweeping view of the crystal blue Gulf. The main floor private deck features a table for six perfect for an outdoor meal while enjoying the sunset. The well-appointed kitchen features updated appliances and full amenities. A full-sized washer/dryer is available in the covered carport area for your exclusive use.<br><br>Seagrove Beach is perfectly located between Seaside/Watercolor to the west and Alys/Rosemary Beach to the east. Close to all the restaurants and shopping, but away from the crowds and traffic congestion.<br><br>All reservations include a starter supply of amenities to include bathroom toiletries, dish soap, dishwasher detergent, and laundry detergent.<br><br>House Rules:<br>-No smoking<br>-No pets allowed<br>-No parties/events<br>-Quiet hours 10:00pm - 8:00am<br>-Minimum age of primary renter is 25 years old",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "GULF FRONT townhome with breathtaking views on 30A! Short walk to the beach!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
